ne.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_006\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_010\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P5\",\n      \"name\": \"Hypothetical pyruvate homocoupling pathway\",\n      \"description\": \"Two pyruvate molecules condensate nonenzymatically into acetolactate, which is then dehydrated/decarboxylated to \u03b1-KIV, entering direct reductive amination to valine.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_007\", \"rxn_008\", \"rxn_006\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_010\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P6\",\n      \"name\": \"HCN-polymer hydrolysis route\",\n      \"description\": \"HCN oligomerizes in aqueous solution; subsequent hydrolysis yields valine, norvaline and isovaline at low selectivity.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_009\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P7\",\n      \"name\": \"Meteorite/interstellar ice UV prebiotic delivery\",\n      \"description\": \"UV photolysis of ices generates amino acid precursors; meteoritic entry or burial in terrestrial pools followed by hydrolysis yields valine.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_010\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P8\",\n      \"name\": \"Pantolactone side-path (competitive sink)\",\n      \"description\": \"Isobutyraldehyde reacts with formaldehyde and HCN under phosphate mineral catalysis, forming pantolactone, a sink away from valine and toward coenzyme-A like compounds.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_011\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_016\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P9\",\n      \"name\": \"Norvaline/isovaline co-formation\",\n      \"description\": \"Parallel to Strecker, isomeric aldehydes (butanal, 2-butanone) formed in the same environments undergo analogous Strecker and hydrolysis steps to yield norvaline and isovaline.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_001\", \"rxn_002\", \"rxn_003\"],\n      \"key_i