xperimentation.']\n\n============================================================\nAddress the above issues in your new network. Do NOT repeat the same mistakes.\n", "raw_response": "{\n  \"target_molecule\": \"Valine\",\n  \"overall_strategy\": \"This synthesis network for prebiotic valine integrates all experimentally demonstrated and literature-supported routes, explicitly correcting and tracking atom and charge balance for each reaction\u2014including competing sinks, co-isomer production, and speculative biosynthetic analogs. Ten converging pathways are constructed: (1) Spark-discharge Strecker synthesis from isobutyraldehyde, (2) direct Strecker formation using exogenous isobutyraldehyde, (3) cyanosulfidic homologation from acetone, (4) metal-catalyzed reductive amination of \u03b1-ketoisovalerate (\u03b1-KIV), (5) Bucherer\u2013Bergs chemistry on \u03b1-KIV, (6) potential interstellar ice photolysis/hydrolysis, (7) radiolysis of HCN polymers, (8) Fischer\u2013Tropsch\u2013type hydrothermal synthesis, (9) competing pantoic acid branch, (10) a speculative biosynthetic analog from pyruvate. All pathways are atom-balanced, specify side-products, and precisely identify molecular structures and mechanistic detail. The C5 skeleton formation bottleneck is explicitly modeled, with speculative/hypothetical steps clearly marked.\",\n  \"molecules\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_001\",\n      \"formula\": \"CH4\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"methane\",\n      \"common_name\": \"methane\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/CH4/h1H4\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": \"Hydrothermal\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_002\",\n      \"formula\": \"N2\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"dinitrogen\",\n      \"common_name\": \"nitrogen\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/N2/c1-2\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": \"Surface\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_003\",\n      \"formula\": \"H2O\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"water\",\n    