ct Strecker formation using exogenous isobutyraldehyde, (3) cyanosulfidic homologation from acetone, (4) metal-catalyzed reductive amination of \u03b1-ketoisovalerate (\u03b1-KIV), (5) Bucherer\u2013Bergs chemistry on \u03b1-KIV, (6) potential interstellar ice photolysis/hydrolysis, (7) radiolysis of HCN polymers, (8) Fischer\u2013Tropsch\u2013type hydrothermal synthesis, (9) competing pantoic acid branch, (10) a speculative biosynthetic analog from pyruvate. All pathways are atom-balanced, specify side-products, and precisely identify molecular structures and mechanistic detail. The C5 skeleton formation bottleneck is explicitly modeled, with speculative/hypothetical steps clearly marked.", "molecules": [{"id": "mol_001", "formula": "CH4", "iupac_name": "methane", "common_name": "methane", "inchi": "InChI=1S/CH4/h1H4", "role": "starting", "environment_formed": "Hydrothermal"}, {"id": "mol_002", "formula": "N2", "iupac_name": "dinitrogen", "common_name": "nitrogen", "inchi": "InChI=1S/N2/c1-2", "role": "starting", "environment_formed": "Surface"}, {"id": "mol_003", "formula": "H2O", "iupac_name": "water", "common_name": "water", "inchi": "InChI=1S/H2O/h1H2", "role": "starting", "environment_formed": "Hydrothermal"}, {"id": "mol_004", "formula": "NH3", "iupac_name": "azane", "common_name": "ammonia", "inchi": "InChI=1S/H3N/h1H3", "role": "starting", "environment_formed": "Surface"}, {"id": "mol_005", "formula": "CO", "iupac_name": "carbon monoxide", "common_name": "carbon monoxide", "inchi": "InChI=1S/CO/c1-2", "role": "starting", "environment_formed": "Hydrothermal"}, {"id": "mol_006", "formula": "H2", "iupac_name": "dihydrogen", "common_name": "hydrogen", "inchi": "InChI=1S/H2/h1H", "role": "starting", "environment_formed": "Hydrothermal"}, {"id": "mol_007", "formula": "HCN", "iupac_name": "hydrogen cyanide", "common_name": "hydrogen cyanide", "inchi": "InChI=1S/CHN/c1-2/h1H", "role": "starting", "environment_formed": "Surface"}, {"id": "mol_008", "formula": "C4H8O